          "guid": "mt5k26um5kamtm2o",
          "message": {
            "text": "The raster-free clone is a pre-terminal observation seam, not a production ownership change. The unchanged node must first prove one non-vacuous final terminal; only then does this clone re-enter the identical production renderer to join CDP face to source SHA, face index, gid, cluster, spans, advances, offsets, and outline. The canonical four-token projection passed the DM-2512 exact validator in the pinned Playwright v1.59.1 noble container (pueue task 88, 2/2 tests), while helper availability moved true to false without changing physical FreeSans facts.",
            "markdown": "The raster-free clone is a pre-terminal observation seam, not a production ownership change. The unchanged node must first prove one non-vacuous final terminal; only then does this clone re-enter the identical production renderer to join CDP face to source SHA, face index, gid, cluster, spans, advances, offsets, and outline. The canonical four-token projection passed the DM-2512 exact validator in the pinned Playwright v1.59.1 noble container (pueue task 88, 2/2 tests), while helper availability moved true to false without changing physical FreeSans facts."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tests/mathml-italic-token.e2e.test.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 159,
                  "endLine": 170,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "function preterminalEvidence(\n  node: CapturedElement,\n  width: number,\n  height: number,\n  transformed: string,\n  face: PlatformFace,\n): RenderEvidence & { run: TextRunProvenanceDiagnostic } {\n  const evidence = renderEvidence(withoutCaptureTextTerminal(node), width, height);\n  const runs = evidence.runs.filter((run) => run.sourceText === transformed);\n  expect(runs, `${node.magicKey}: exact pre-terminal selected run`).toHaveLength(1);\n  assertSelectedRun(runs[0]!, transformed, face, node.magicKey ?? transformed);\n  return { ...evidence, run: runs[0]! };"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
